@format 1
@id project.save-session
@title Save session
@area 7. Project persistence
@entry input
@summary Capture the current tab arrangement and workspace state and persist it as the next startup session.
@section II. Functionality
@flow TB
@related application.shutdown, project.restore-session
@tag session
@tag save

@alias window = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainWindow.PWindow
@alias scene = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScene

[input] Main window closes <input>
- Begin session capture during window close @ window.PWindowCloseHandle(...)
> capture

[capture] Capture session model <process>
- Read tab layout keys, output presets, workspace layouts, relay slots, custom names, and active index @ window.PWindowSceneRead(...)
> save

[save] Persist session <storage>
- Create the application-data folder when needed and serialize the session record @ scene.LSceneStateSave(...)
> result

[result] Session durable <output>
= The next startup can reconstruct the current tabs and workspace state.
